      4 <style=coinColor>{2:CommaNumber}</style>

      3 <style=coinColor>{1:CommaNumber}</style>

      2 <style=coinColor>{0:CommaNumber}</style></size></b>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_1
    value: <style=title><size=27>BUNNY WILD
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_2
    value: <style=title><size=27>SWEET O' HOLIC
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_1
    value: '<size=22>- Bunny Wild feature is triggered randomly during reel spin.

      - Up to 5 reels turn Wild.

'
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_2
    value: "<size=22>- 3 Scatters triggers the Sweet O' Holic bonus. \n- Pick among
      3 candies to randomly play one of the following: Bunny Wheel, Big Bunny \n  Spins,
      or Sweet Peeps. \n\n<b>Bonus 1 : Bunny Wheel</b>\n- 3 spins are awarded initially
      on the wheel.\n- User may receive a credit award, free spins, or Sweet Bunny.\n-
      Sweet Bunny rewards all credit amounts located above the Sweet Bunny wedge.\n"
  - key: PAYTABLE_WAY_INFO
    value: <size=24><color=#00eaff>40LINES</color></size>
  - key: PAYTABLE_BET_INFO
    value: '<size=24><color=#00eaff>Bet Per Line: 1</color></size>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_3
    value: <style=title><size=27>SWEET O' HOLIC
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_4
    value: '<style=title><size=27>GOD OF WEALTH JACKPOT

'
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_3
    value: "<size=18><b>Bonus 2: Big Bunny Spins</b>\n- Big Bunny Spins triggers 7
      free spins. Scatter appears on reel 5 only.\n- If Scatter appears, receive +2
      free spins and reel expansion by 1 row. \n- Reels may expand up to 10 rows.
      \ \n\n<b>Bonus 3: Sweet Peeps</b>\n- Select among 3 Sweet Peeps options:\n     -
      1 Pick and 6x multiplier\n     - 2 Picks and 4x multiplier\n     - 3 Picks and
      2x multiplier\n- User will play 3 rounds of picker bonus.\n- In each round,
      pick jellies to receive credit amount or \u201Cpeeps.\u201D Any credit amount
      will be multiplied by the   \n   multiplier.\n- Picking a \"peep\" will increase
      the multiplier and award 1 additional pick.\n- User may randomly select up to
      3 \u201Cpeeps\u201D in each round.\n"
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_4
    value: "<size=22>- Wild symbols appearing during either Base or Free Games may
      randomly trigger the Fortune Coin Jackpot. \n- Pick among 12 jackpot coins and
      until 3 of the same jackpots are selected. \n- Mini, Minor, Mega, or Grand jackpot
      may be awarded.\n"
  - key: CONTENTS_GAME_TITLE
    value: Jelly Bunny
